+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use a least-recently-used (LRU) eviction policy with a fixed time-to-live (TTL) of 300 seconds for cache entries. LRU was chosen because its semantics are simpler and easier to reason about and tune in production.
